WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.073
My doctor says I need a procedure next month, and someone has to drive me home.

2
00:00:06.273 --> 00:00:12.076
I live alone. Who do I ask?

3
00:00:12.276 --> 00:00:18.076
So I told Haven what was coming up.

4
00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:24.079
It asked me one thing at a time. I just answered.

5
00:00:24.279 --> 00:00:30.601
It found a free escort service, a key lockbox, and my neighbor Doris for Fifi.

6
00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:36.604
I didn't have to ask anyone for a big favor.

7
00:00:36.804 --> 00:00:42.607
Doris signed up for mornings, and Haven told me in What's new.

8
00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:48.613
Then I printed my fridge card.

9
00:00:48.813 --> 00:00:54.622
The night before, Haven showed me who is doing what.

10
00:00:54.822 --> 00:01:00.625
Home safe. Haven wrote a thank-you note to Doris.

11
00:01:00.825 --> 00:01:04.928
That's Ruth's story. Now make your own plan.
